id=BitPerfect.module
name=BitPerfect Universal Audio Engine
version=v5.5-Universal
versionCode=550
author=Kostyantyn Matviyevskyy aka kostyamat & Antigravity (c)2026
description=Bit-to-bit audio for QF001/K706. v5.5 establishes SSOT: restores 2-channel ALSA capture with stereo hardware speaker loopback on AuxMIC, maps AEC to Google WebRTC AEC3 (Fullband echo cancellation without 4kHz telephone cutoff), restores Built-In Back Mic and full input sample rates (8..48kHz), and adds dedicated RAW unprocessed input for wDSP/Vosk.
